{% comment %} Returns & Exchanges Page {% endcomment %}
<div class="simple-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="simple-page-content">
      <h1 class="simple-page-title">Returns & Exchanges</h1>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>All Sales Are Final</h2>
        <p>Due to the digital nature of our products, all sales are final. Once a plan package has been delivered to your email, we are unable to offer refunds or exchanges.</p>
        <p>We strongly encourage reviewing your selected plan carefully before purchasing. If you have questions about a specific plan — dimensions, included drawings, compatibility with your build method, or anything else — please reach out before you buy. We're happy to help.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Before You Buy</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Start with the <strong>Planning Study Set ($99)</strong> to review the layout, room sizes, and elevations before committing to the full Construction Set.</li>
          <li>Schedule a <strong>Free Design Consultation</strong> if you have questions about engineering, customization, or whether a plan is right for your land.</li>
          <li>Your $99 Study Set purchase includes a credit voucher toward the full Construction Set.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Wrong Plan or File Issue?</h2>
        <p>If you received the wrong files or there is a technical issue with your download, contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com">larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com</a> and we will make it right.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="simple-page-block">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com">larry@barnhaussteelbuilders.com</a><br>
        Phone: <a href="tel:2105177267">(210) 517-7267</a><br>
        Hours: Mon–Fri, 8AM–6PM CST</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.simple-page { padding: 60px 0; }
.simple-page-content { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
.simple-page-title { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid #B8860B; padding-bottom: 16px; }
.simple-page-block { margin-bottom: 36px; }
.simple-page-block h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #B8860B; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.simple-page-block p { color: #ccc; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.simple-page-block ul { padding-left: 20px; }
.simple-page-block ul li { color: #ccc; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.simple-page-block a { color: #B8860B; text-decoration: underline; }
</style>

